# The first V.32 call that ever carried data, 7 Sep 2026.  V.8 selects
# V.32 out of the far end's menu, Figure 4's start-up runs, the rate
# signals settle on 9600 trellis coded, and the same banner every other
# fixture in this directory carries comes back at eight times the speed
# of the V.21 one.
#
# Everything V.32 has -- the coding layer, the start-up, the data pump,
# the echo canceller -- has to work for these fifty-one bytes to appear,
# and nothing else in the suite asks for all of it at once against a real
# line.
